invalid type: string "DPDP Act 2023, Section 39. Bar of jurisdiction (Chapter IX: Miscellaneous)\nNo civil court shall have the jurisdiction to entertain any suit or\nproceeding in respect of any matter for which the Board is empowered under the provisions of this Act\nand no injunction shall be granted by any court or other authority in respect of any action taken or to be\n 1860).", expected i64